;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/e24fcb18-2eb0-4540-82ce-ab9277cc5d6a.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"5a2d\"></p><p data-vmark=\"2614\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/1efe5be8-f75b-4f74-9560-1b184d1ae904.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"fe96\"></p><p data-vmark=\"82d3\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/2f9000dc-9b45-4f12-a68d-6069a7286d3f.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"bc97\"></p><p data-vmark=\"f14b\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/6ac56c3f-2ea4-450d-a69d-ad31c7d0b5a9.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"e646\"></p><p data-vmark=\"72db\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/5503373d-6474-4d53-8d8f-91ed10593836.gif\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"8957\" data-preview=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/5503373d-6474-4d53-8d8f-91ed10593836.gif?x-bce-process=image/format,f_png\" data-advance=\"W3siVHlwZSI6IndlYnBhIiwiVXJsIjoiaHR0cHM6Ly9pbWcuaXRob21lLmNvbS9uZXdzdXBsb2FkZmlsZXMvMjAyNi84L2VhYmE2MWIyLTgxMDQtNGU0Ni1iNWJmLWYyN2NiMGE5MjQwYi53ZWJwIn1d\"></p><h3 data-vmark=\"45d1\">全生态覆盖，Mac / 三方 PC 也能用超级小爱 2.0</h3><p data-vmark=\"e9a5\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/00853d96-3b34-488b-a3b9-2be7cd8f4291.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"18c2\"></p><h3 data-vmark=\"5ea3\">小米端云隐私计算系统</h3><p data-vmark=\"1db3\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/bff3840e-578b-4ee2-bd62-2ae2e8734aa7.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"0f75\"></p><p data-vmark=\"8f8f\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/0450a691-e1a5-4325-b90e-893c8f9d80a1.png\" w=\"1080\" h=\"608\" data-vmark=\"cec2\"></p><p data-vmark=\"039c\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src